From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:33:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] build: lower the libei floor to 1.2.1

Ubuntu 24.04 ships libei 1.2.1. With the EIS_EVENT_SYNC case behind the
check of the earlier patch, the code uses no libei API newer than 1.2.

Nothing is lost compared with libei 1.3.0.

---
diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index c8059cb5d..fd7f84b70 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@ libcanberra_req = '>= 0.26'
 libwacom_req = '>= 0.13'
 atk_req = '>= 2.5.3'
 harfbuzz_req = '>= 2.6'
-libei_req = '>= 1.3.0'
+libei_req = '>= 1.2.1'
 libdisplay_info_req = '>= 0.1.1'
 
 # optional version requirements
